<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 418-6 AT TEA V AUSTRALIA (118).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 418-6 AT TEA V AUSTRALIA (118).</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 418-6 in reply to Australia's first innings of 118 at tea, on the second day of the first test match at Edgbaston on Friday.</p>
</text>
